---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About — Bayou Brew Coffee"
  description="A small coffee shop in the Houston Heights, open since 2018. Here's who we are and how we pour."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow stack">
      <header class="stack">
        <p class="tagline">Slow coffee. Houston pace.</p>
        <h1>About us</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          We opened on Yale Street in 2018. Two Houston folks, one espresso
          machine, a short list of drinks. Not much has changed.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="stack">
        <h2>How we started</h2>
        <p>
          We wanted a corner of the Heights where you could get a real cup and
          a hello. So we took the spot between the post office and the cleaners,
          painted it, and started pouring. The regulars showed up the first
          week. They're still here.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="stack">
        <h2>How we pour</h2>
        <p>
          We buy small. We work with a couple of roasters we trust and rotate
          what's good — Ethiopian Yirgacheffe, single origin, washed one month;
          something from Colombia the next. When the beans change, we tell you.
        </p>
        <p>
          We're not trying to be everything. Drip, pour-over, and whatever
          reserve microlot we just got in. That's the list, and we'd rather
          pour those three well than stretch the menu thin.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="stack">
        <h2>The neighborhood</h2>
        <p>
          Come by on a Saturday and you'll know half the room by name. Bring
          your dog. Sit on the bench out front. We're open early because the
          Heights gets up early, and we close at two because we like our
          afternoons too.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact">Come find us</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .narrow {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: 20px;
  }

  h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
</style>
